    {
      "source": "Note that discarded <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Result.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Result</code></a> objects must be consumed according\nto the R2DBC spec via either <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Result.html#getRowsUpdated--\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Result.getRowsUpdated()</code></a> or\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Result.html#map-java.util.function.BiFunction-\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Result.map(BiFunction)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "注意，被丢弃的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Result.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Result</code></a> 对象必须根据 R2DBC 规范，通过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Result.html#getRowsUpdated--\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Result.getRowsUpdated()</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Result.html#map-java.util.function.BiFunction-\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Result.map(BiFunction)</code></a> 进行消费。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Typically, implementations invoke the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html#execute--\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement.execute()</code></a> method\nto initiate execution of the statement object.\n\nFor example:",
      "translation": "通常，实现会调用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html#execute--\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement.execute()</code></a> 方法来启动语句对象的执行。\n\n例如：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement</code></a> for a stream of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Result.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Result</code></a> objects.",
      "translation": "执行给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement</code></a> 以获取 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Result.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Result</code></a> 对象的流。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>statement</code> - the request to execute",
      "translation": "<code>statement</code> - 执行请求",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the delayed result stream",
      "translation": "延迟结果流",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This is a functional interface and can therefore be used as the assignment target for a lambda expression or method reference.",
      "translation": "这是一个功能接口，因此可用作 Lambda 表达式或方法引用的赋值目标。",
